  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the App\'s UI**\n\nI\'m starting to visualize the app\'s initial screens based on the provided screenshot. The key element is clearly a \"TaskMentor.ai\" brand logo with the \"COPILOT\" title. I\'m focusing on incorporating these visuals into the header and figuring out how to hotlink images from the HTML. My goal is to get a basic structure up and running quickly.\n\n\n**Visualizing Key App Elements**\n\nI\'m now diving into the details of the Employee Mobile App view. I\'m focusing on the \"Active Tasks\" card, trying to replicate the dynamic elements like the \"High Priority\" and \"Locked to Ali\" indicators. I also am working to model the timer, progress bar and level progress in the mockup. I need to make the simulated view helper badge and overall design clean and easy to navigate.\n\n\n**Analyzing Full Implementation Scope**\n\nI\'ve moved on to examining the provided HTML mockup code and the workspace files in more detail. I\'m focusing on incorporating the specific action buttons, like the \"Ask AI Mentor for Help\" with the [\342\200\242 Online] indicator, and \"AI Extension\" plus \"Submit Proof\". The anti-hoarding policy card is next, along with the bottom dock layout. Also, I must ensure full implementation of the rich UI components, and rich Gemini interactivity, and syncing manager dashboard functionality.\n\n\n"
