  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing App Structure**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting the app\'s structural components. I am evaluating the features displayed in the image and user\'s HTML and taking note of the top header. The key components I have noted so far are `TaskMentor.ai` logo with gradient sparkles, the `COPILOT V2.4` badge, and the subtitle \"AI-Driven Onboarding, Micro-Tasks &\"\n\n\n**Dissecting UI Components**\n\nI\'ve moved on to examining the notification toast system\'s functionality. I\'m focusing on the animation, the bot icon\'s placement, and the \"close\" button\'s usability. Also, I\'m now taking a close look at the simulated employee view within the iPhone 15 Pro frame. Specifically, the \"\342\234\250 Simulated Employee View\" badge, the dynamic island, and the status bar are all under scrutiny.\n\n\n**Evaluating Task Interface**\n\nI am now closely evaluating the active task interface. I\'m noting the XP animations and team ranking, specifically the level progression and percentage bar. I\'m carefully analyzing the tabs for active, auto-queue, and completed tasks. In the active tasks tab, I\'m examining the priority badges, title and subtitle of the card, and the countdown timer details including the ticking clock feature. The progress checkpoint slider also holds my attention, and I am noting the milestones. Finally, the interactive action buttons offer further insight.\n\n\n**Investigating Interactive Elements**\n\nI\'m now diving into the interactive elements within the task interface. The pulsating dot\'s function to open the AI Mentor drawer is noted, alongside the modal options for extending time and submitting proof. I\'m also examining the anti-hoarding policy\'s implications and how it\'s conveyed visually. Finally, I\'m analyzing the Auto-Queue and Completed tabs to understand the sequential task display and task completion tracking mechanisms.\n\n\n**Examining AI Interaction**\n\nI\'m now investigating the AI-driven interactions within the task flow. Specifically, I\'m analyzing the \"Pass Compliance Micro-Quiz\" and \"Attend Legal Onboarding Briefing\" tasks, along with their XP rewards. The AI Mentor Chat Drawer is under scrutiny, examining its header, context, message stream, and quick prompt chips. I\'m also delving into the functionality of the \"AI Time Extension\" and \"Submit Proof\" modals, focusing on the features and user actions.\n\n\n**Reviewing Verification Process**\n\nI\'m now closely reviewing the \"Run AI Vision Check\" process for submitted work documents. I\'m focusing on the loading animation with OCR and the confidence score display. I\'m noting the confetti celebration and XP rewards for valid documents, as well as the fraud alert and manager dashboard flagging for fake ones. I\'m also examining the mobile bottom dock interface, including its task, AI mentor, rank, and profile components.\n\n\n**Assessing Table Dynamics**\n\nI\'m now deeply engaged in understanding the tracker table\'s functionality and how it relates to the broader system. I\'m noting the search and filter options and how they dynamically adjust the displayed data. I\'m focusing on the individual rows, especially how the data syncs with the mobile screen. Furthermore, I\'m analyzing the actions such as the XP bonus and the \"Resolve Flag\" button, with a close eye on their implications on workflow. I\'m also now shifting attention to the gamification elements, specifically the leaderboard.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_492235"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"export interface Task {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  category: \'Legal Ops\' | \'Finance\' | \'IT Engineering\' | \'Product Ops\';\\n  priority: \'High\' | \'Medium\' | \'Low\';\\n  assignedTo: string;\\n  assigneeDept: string;\\n  assigneeRole: string;\\n  assigneeAvatar: string;\\n  xpReward: number;\\n  estimatedMinutes: number;\\n  remainingSeconds: number;\\n  totalSeconds: number;\\n  progressPercent: number;\\n  status: \'In Progress\' | \'AI Verified\' | \'Flagged\' | \'Queued\' | \'Completed\';\\n  locked: boolean;\\n  queriesCount: number;\\n  antiHoardingEnabled: boolean;\\n  completedAt?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ChatMessage {\\n  id: string;\\n  sender: \'ai\' | \'user\';\\n  text: string;\\n  timestamp: string;\\n  richContent?: {\\n    type: \'steps\' | \'code\' | \'warning\';\\n    steps?: string[];\\n    code?: string;\\n    warning?: string;\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AuditLogItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  message: string;\\n  type: \'indigo\' | \'emerald\' | \'amber\' | \'rose\';\\n  icon: string;\\n  timestamp: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface EmployeeRank {\\n  rank: number;\\n  name: string;\\n  dept: string;\\n  tasksDone: number;\\n  xp: number;\\n  level: number;\\n  streakText?: string;\\n  avatar: string;\\n}\\n\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/index.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating type definitions\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create src/types/index.ts\"}"
