  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing UI Components**\n\nOkay, I\'m now actively constructing the necessary user interface (UI) components. I\'m focusing on the `src/components/Header.tsx` file for now. The plan includes a \"TaskMentor.ai\" header with a gradient and sparkles logo, the \"Copilot v2.4\" badge, a subtitle that reads \"AI-Driven Onboarding, Micro-Tasks & Live Mentorship,\" and a view toggle.\n\n\n**Adding Mobile UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now integrating the mobile UI components. I\'ve focused on `MobileAppView.tsx`, adding an iPhone 15 Pro frame with a Dynamic Island, status bar, and user profile.  I\'ve incorporated the glowing mobile app indicator with an active status, and included the `Manager Dashboard` button with the active tag. I\'ve also integrated the live demo status elements. I\'m moving onto the Active Tasks mobile tab.\n\n\n**Designing Mobile Tabs**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the mobile UI tabs. I\'ve designed a progress checkpoint slider and action buttons like \"Ask AI Mentor for Help.\" I\'ve also incorporated the Anti-Hoarding Policy card and the Auto-Queue and Completed task lists. The bottom dock includes Tasks, AI Mentor, Rank, and Profile options.\n\nI\'m now creating the `AiMentorDrawer.tsx` component, which slides up from the bottom of the phone mockup, and incorporates elements such as the bot icon, a header with the copilot name and context, a close button, chat history with conversational onboarding guidance, quick prompt chips, and a chat input field. I am also working on `ExtensionModal.tsx`, a modal that extends AI time, evaluates learning behavior, and logs the extension to the manager.\n\n\n**Developing Manager Dashboard**\n\nI\'m now diving into the `ManagerDashboardView.tsx` component for desktop, focusing on a control center with key performance indicator (KPI) cards that include Active Employees, Avg. Onboarding Speed, Manager Hours Saved, and Anti-Cheat/Fraud Alerts. I\'m building a live employee task tracker table with filtering by department and status, synchronized to employee progress. I\'m also implementing actions for the tracker such as inspect mobile screen, XP bonuses, and resolving flags. I\'m also including a leaderboard and rewards system, and AI analytics and a real-time audit log with a CSV export option. I\'m also looking at the assignment of tasks for the manager.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_537632"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { Bot, CheckCircle2, AlertTriangle, Clock, X } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\nexport interface ToastData {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  message: string;\\n  type?: \'indigo\' | \'emerald\' | \'amber\' | \'rose\';\\n}\\n\\ninterface ToastProps {\\n  toast: ToastData | null;\\n  onClose: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Toast: React.FC<ToastProps> = ({ toast, onClose }) => {\\n  if (!toast) return null;\\n\\n  const type = toast.type || \'indigo\';\\n\\n  const icons = {\\n    indigo: <Bot className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-indigo-400\\\" />,\\n    emerald: <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400\\\" />,\\n    amber: <Clock className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-400\\\" />,\\n    rose: <AlertTriangle className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-rose-400\\\" />,\\n  };\\n\\n  const bgStyles = {\\n    indigo: \'border-indigo-500/50 bg-slate-900\',\\n    emerald: \'border-emerald-500/50 bg-slate-900\',\\n    amber: \'border-amber-500/50 bg-slate-900\',\\n    rose: \'border-rose-500/50 bg-slate-900\',\\n  };\\n\\n  const iconBgStyles = {\\n    indigo: \'bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400\',\\n    emerald: \'bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400\',\\n    amber: \'bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400\',\\n    rose: \'bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-400\',\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className={`fixed top-16 right-5 z-50 max-w-sm w-full border ${bgStyles[type]} shadow-2xl rounded-xl p-3 flex items-start gap-3 animate-bounce-in transition-all duration-300`}>\\n      <div className={`p-2 rounded-lg shrink-0 ${iconBgStyles[type]}`}>\\n        {icons[type]}\\n      </div>\\n      <div className=\\\"flex-1 text-xs\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"font-bold text-white text-sm\\\">{toast.title}</div>\\n        <div className=\\\"text-slate-300 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed\\\">{toast.message}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <button\\n        onClick={onClose}\\n        className=\\\"text-slate-400 hover:text-white p-1 rounded-md transition\\\"\\n        aria-label=\\\"Close toast\\\"\\n      >\\n        <X className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Toast.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating Toast component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create src/components/Toast.tsx\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "create_file"
    }
