  planner_response {
    response: "I have built the **TaskMentor.ai Copilot v2.4** application matching the design, layouts, and interactive behaviors:\n\n### What was built:\n\n- **Top Navigation Bar & Dual-View Switcher:**\n  - **Employee Mobile App** view (with live pulsing activity indicator) and **Manager Dashboard** view (with active cohort counter and real-time synchronization).\n  - Status indicator for **Auto-Lock: Active** and simulated notification triggers.\n\n- **Employee Mobile View (iPhone 15 Pro Frame):**\n  - **Dynamic Island & Status Bar:** Clickable dynamic island with AI status indicator, live carrier/battery icons, and time display.\n  - **Gamified Profile Header:** Shows Ali Mammadov (AZ), Junior Specialist \342\200\242 Legal Ops, live XP tracker (`350 XP`, Rank #2 in Team), and Level 4 Onboarder progress bar.\n  - **Workflow Tabs:** Interactive switching across *Active Tasks (1)*, *Auto-Queue (3)*, and *Completed (8)*.\n  - **Active Task Card:** Priority tag, Anti-Hoarding exclusive lock, ticking countdown timer (`01:24:07 / 02:30:00`), interactive progress slider (`40% Completed` through *Drafting*, *Reviewing*, *AI Proof*), and Anti-Hoarding policy summary.\n  - **Action Buttons & Modals:**\n    - **Ask AI Mentor for Help:** Slides up the interactive AI Mentor drawer with quick prompt chips, step-by-step documentation guides, SLA Clause 4 tips, and chat message sending.\n    - **AI Extension:** Opens the evaluation modal that validates learning queries and grants +30 mins to the countdown timer.\n    - **Submit Proof:** Opens the AI Vision Verification modal with a test toggle between *Valid Work Document* and *Fake Photo*, running simulated OCR/signature scans, awarding +50 XP with confetti or triggering a Fraud Alert.\n  - **Mobile Dock:** Bottom dock with direct shortcuts to Tasks, AI Mentor drawer, Rank notifications, and Profile details.\n\n- **Manager Dashboard (Operations & Mentorship Control Center):**\n  - **4 Live KPI Metrics:** Active Employees Onboarding (`14`), Avg. Onboarding Speed (`3.2 Days`), Manager Hours Saved (`42 hrs`), and Anti-Cheat / Fraud Alerts (`1` or `2`).\n  - **Live Employee Task Tracker:** Filterable by department and status. Synchronized in real time with Ali\'s mobile progress slider and XP, plus quick actions for manual bonus awarding and fraud flag resolution.\n  - **Leaderboard & Rewards:** Top 3 rankings with dynamic XP updates and an *\"Award Monthly Bonus ($150 Gift Card)\"* button with confetti effects.\n  - **AI Analytics & Real-Time Audit Log:** Live event feed tracking AI Mentor chats, time extensions, vision verification passes, and fraud alerts, complete with a functional **Export CSV Log** button.\n  - **Assign New Task Modal:** Dispatches new onboarding micro-tasks with Anti-Hoarding policy toggles."
    modified_response: "I have built the **TaskMentor.ai Copilot v2.4** application matching the design, layouts, and interactive behaviors:\n\n### What was built:\n\n- **Top Navigation Bar & Dual-View Switcher:**\n  - **Employee Mobile App** view (with live pulsing activity indicator) and **Manager Dashboard** view (with active cohort counter and real-time synchronization).\n  - Status indicator for **Auto-Lock: Active** and simulated notification triggers.\n\n- **Employee Mobile View (iPhone 15 Pro Frame):**\n  - **Dynamic Island & Status Bar:** Clickable dynamic island with AI status indicator, live carrier/battery icons, and time display.\n  - **Gamified Profile Header:** Shows Ali Mammadov (AZ), Junior Specialist \342\200\242 Legal Ops, live XP tracker (`350 XP`, Rank #2 in Team), and Level 4 Onboarder progress bar.\n  - **Workflow Tabs:** Interactive switching across *Active Tasks (1)*, *Auto-Queue (3)*, and *Completed (8)*.\n  - **Active Task Card:** Priority tag, Anti-Hoarding exclusive lock, ticking countdown timer (`01:24:07 / 02:30:00`), interactive progress slider (`40% Completed` through *Drafting*, *Reviewing*, *AI Proof*), and Anti-Hoarding policy summary.\n  - **Action Buttons & Modals:**\n    - **Ask AI Mentor for Help:** Slides up the interactive AI Mentor drawer with quick prompt chips, step-by-step documentation guides, SLA Clause 4 tips, and chat message sending.\n    - **AI Extension:** Opens the evaluation modal that validates learning queries and grants +30 mins to the countdown timer.\n    - **Submit Proof:** Opens the AI Vision Verification modal with a test toggle between *Valid Work Document* and *Fake Photo*, running simulated OCR/signature scans, awarding +50 XP with confetti or triggering a Fraud Alert.\n  - **Mobile Dock:** Bottom dock with direct shortcuts to Tasks, AI Mentor drawer, Rank notifications, and Profile details.\n\n- **Manager Dashboard (Operations & Mentorship Control Center):**\n  - **4 Live KPI Metrics:** Active Employees Onboarding (`14`), Avg. Onboarding Speed (`3.2 Days`), Manager Hours Saved (`42 hrs`), and Anti-Cheat / Fraud Alerts (`1` or `2`).\n  - **Live Employee Task Tracker:** Filterable by department and status. Synchronized in real time with Ali\'s mobile progress slider and XP, plus quick actions for manual bonus awarding and fraud flag resolution.\n  - **Leaderboard & Rewards:** Top 3 rankings with dynamic XP updates and an *\"Award Monthly Bonus ($150 Gift Card)\"* button with confetti effects.\n  - **AI Analytics & Real-Time Audit Log:** Live event feed tracking AI Mentor chats, time extensions, vision verification passes, and fraud alerts, complete with a functional **Export CSV Log** button.\n  - **Assign New Task Modal:** Dispatches new onboarding micro-tasks with Anti-Hoarding policy toggles."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\330\001\n\325\001\001i\024}\023*\320\304\313\024\354\023\235\031\r>\244\247\200>\240\243\314G\375;&\306\201+\271\253[\262\303\034m#>\312y}\370\277\256Yq\000\264O\333YR\037\306\263\264\210\000[l\212\324\364\004?\244Wc~ VAgH_\034\005;\255|k\265K1\364*\361\343\004\215t\354\267)\223\377\307\027\370Im:\210iY\n\352\347qh\262\032\030\a\256C\\\235\275Zu\213\346\026\372\261\314\275a\307\351\032\016=[\036\335\035\371N\311kh\227\006&%\005\271\312\365\b\326\342\362\252e\250J3\213\334\347\314\326^\270\274]\024;\242S~\240P\246\221\310\223G[+\212\203\231\362\211\321\326\352\201\254\355\2629\211J\332o\246\257\316\244V \232X\307\036\030\254"
